Source: https://github.com/ThibaultTricard/Interval-Shading
Revision: 4b4a256942539fc8a291f13422684a628757d758
Adapted algorithm: src/shader/singleTet/mesh.mesh projected-tetrahedron
classification and screen-space interval fan. The Rust/wgpu implementation uses
compute-generated proxies, reciprocal depth, affine density integration, an
analytic near-eye fallback and per-sample composition rather than mesh shaders.
No upstream models, environment maps or LavaCake dependency are included.

